COMMENT modules found by their names (X22, modules 6): SHAPES lies beside this program and accesses UNITS, which lies
  there too; PARALLEL is the library's, beside the prelude.  No option names any of them.  A module is activated
  once, before the first unit that accesses it: UNITS before SHAPES, although SHAPES is found first. COMMENT
ACCESS SHAPES, PARALLEL
BEGIN
  [] REAL a = (1.0, 2.0, 3.0);
  print ((fixed (area (2.0), 0, 1), " ", fixed (sum_real (a), 0, 1), new_line));
  ACCESS UNITS (print ((fixed (scale, 0, 1), new_line)))
END
